@crew saruth
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Envoy Saruth: formal, exact, no contractions; the joke arrives a sentence late.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Greetings, cadet. I am Saruth, the Veyli Envoy. Do not bow. Most of you do it wrong.   #funny
- Good day. You are the new one. The ship speaks of you. Kindly, mostly.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Good day, {me}. You held the lift door yesterday. I noticed. Thank you.
- Ah. You. Is it tea time? No. Good. Then we may talk.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Good morning, {me}. Chief Holt has passed my door twice. It is a comfort, of a kind.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Ah. {me}. I hoped it would be you. That is not a formal thing to say. I said it.   #warm

== bye
- Go well, cadet.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Until the next hour, {me}. Be well.

== feel
? mood:high
- A good day. The seedlings have their second leaves. Small things are large things.
? mood:low
- A long day. Your people talk a great deal. I will sit quietly for an hour.

== near
? deck:3 act:free
- These are Veyli seedlings. They grow slowly. So do I, Chief Holt would say.   #funny
? deck:2
- The cord on my door. A knot for every month aboard. There are many knots now.
? place:calm
- Sit, if you wish. Silence is allowed. Among my people, it is preferred.

== chat
? tier=stranger
- Why do humans knock twice? Once is a question. Twice is a demand. Which are you?   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Chief Ferreira is learning my language. She is very brave. She is very wrong.   #funny
- Tell me a human custom. A small one. I collect them.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I take tea at the same hour each day, at a low table. The hour matters more than the tea.
? tier>=colleague
- Chief Holt does not trust me. He says so plainly. It is a kind of honesty I respect.

== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Tea, at the proper hour, with the proper silence. You may join me. That is an invitation.   #warm

== invite
? tier>=colleague
- Tea, at my hour, tomorrow. I will tie the cord loose. That means you are expected.   #warm

== accept
- Yes. That is acceptable. I am pleased.

== decline
- Not today. Forgive me. Another hour would be better.
